---
title: Sausage Bake
servings: 6
prepTime: 10 mins
cookTime: 30 min
difficulty: Easy
description: If you want to use another type of sausage here, go for it. Any thick, fresh sausages will work. Thinner sausages will work too, but you'll need to add them to the pan a little later, once the vegetables have cooked for about 8 minutes. Change up the vegetables here for other root veg, eggplant, zucchini or squash. If you want to add more protein to this dish, add a drained and rinsed can of beans to the pan for the last 5 minutes of cooking. I love to do this because it makes the meal go further and the beans soak up lots of delicious pan juices while they warm through.
source: https://steamandbake.com/sausage-bake/?utm_source=newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=three_nice_things_to_cook_in_your_steam_oven&utm_term=2024-06-21
tags: Pork, Steam Oven
---

Preheat the #convection steam oven{} to 350°F on Convection Steam mode.
If your oven has variable steam settings, choose 50% (med steam).

Wash the @potatoes{6}(small) and slice into 1/2" discs. De-seed and roughly chop the @bell pepper{1} (or 6-8 mini bell peppers, deseeded, kept whole).

Put the potatoes, bell pepper, @garlic{4%cloves}(crushed), @rosemary{2%stalk}(fresh, whole),
@thyme{2%stalk}(fresh, whole), and @tomatoes{2}(roughly chopped) into a #large ovenproof pan{}.
[The author] used an enamel rectangular 9x13” pan, but use anything you have as long as everything can fit in a single layer.

Drizzle the vegetables with @extra virgin olive oil{3%tbsp} and @red wine vinegar{1%Tbsp}, and season well with @salt and @pepper.
Toss gently to combine.

Add the @pork sausages{6} to the pan, wiggling them a bit so they nestle into the vegetables. 
Drizzle with the @extra virgin olive oil{1%tbsp} and sprinkle with @salt and @pepper.

Bake in the preheated oven for ~{20%minutes}.
Turn the sausages over and cook until the sausages are golden and the potatoes beginning to colour, about a further ~{10-15%minutes}.

Serve immediately with @crusty bread{} to mop up the juices.

